ver  mark is that not only are their diamonds  incredibly special and rare and very  sparkly  but they are also responsibly sourced  and i think that now more than ever  couples are really you know paying  attention to where their jewelry comes  from and the investment that they're  making and so this is something that you  can be proud to wear i would say jewelry  is a big trend um coming out of the  pandemic now more than ever and of  course big weddings are back so think  big wedding dresses think uh you know  lots of special details whether it's  gifting your bridal party um or gifting  the mother of the bride or father of the  bride with  special things that mean something to  you as a couple it's like that big  storybook wedding i mean seeing your  dress that big ball gown so so you're  kind of saying you know after two years  of having to take it easy now it's kind  of like go big or go home go as big as  you want  i like that and and really quick on the  rings i saw a lot of solitaires that  looked like a lot of round cuts is that  probably more popular now we actually  have a variety of different cut stones  we have everything from rounds to ovals  to emeralds to cushions and there is  something for everybody i encourage you  to check out t-bird jewels um here in  las vegas or of course forevermark.com  wonderful well again michaela  congratulations on your own wedding  photos looked beautiful  all about those forever moments that we  appreciate you getting all of our brides  here in las vegas ready have a great  morning
 

